{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "help-pr-mobile-apis-only",
    "name": "Help PR — Mobile APIs only",
    "description": "Postman collection for **`/api/mobile/*`** (partner app).\n\n## Suggested test order\n1. **Location** → States → Cities → Areas → Pincodes\n2. **Register** or **Login**\n3. **Update → Basic details** → profile, location, `partner_services` (sets `franchise_id`)\n4. **Catalog** → Categories → Services\n5. **Update → Documents verification** → upload verification files\n6. **Update → Bank accounts** → one or more bank accounts\n\nOr use **Update → Full update (PUT /update)** for complete onboarding payload in one call.\n\n## Update endpoints\n| Endpoint | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|\n| `PUT /update/basic-details` | Profile, location, `partner_services`, optional `image` |\n| `PUT /update/documents` | Verification files only (`aadhar_card`, `pan_card`, etc.) |\n| `PUT /update/bank-accounts` | `bank_account` JSON (array replaces all; object upserts one) |\n| `PUT /update` | All of the above in one request |\n\nErrors: `{ success: false, status, message }` only.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Partner",
      "description": "Partner mobile — `routes/mobile/partner/partner_routes.js` + `location_routes.js`",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const t = j?.data?.auth_token;",
                  "  if (t) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', t);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', t);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('partnerId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?.email) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('email', String(j.data.email));",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Priya\",\n  \"date_of_birth\": \"2003-05-23\",\n  \"phone_number\": \"+916309654123\",\n  \"email\": \"partner.mobile+{{$timestamp}}@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Priya@123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "register"]
            },
            "description": "**POST /api/mobile/partner/register**\n\n- No Authorization\n- **Required:** name, email, phone_number, password, date_of_birth (18+)\n- Response: `data.auth_token`, `data._id`, `data.email`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const t = j?.data?.auth_token;",
                  "  if (t) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', t);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', t);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('partnerId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?.email) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('email', String(j.data.email));",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"device_token\": \"{{deviceToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "login"]
            },
            "description": "**POST /api/mobile/partner/login**\n\n- No Authorization\n- **Required:** email, password\n- **Optional:** device_token (FCM push token; saved on user when provided)\n\n**401 messages:**\n- Unknown email → `Invalid email.`\n- Wrong password → `Invalid password.`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
