        {
          "name": "Update",
          "description": "Partner profile update split by use case. All use **multipart/form-data** + **Bearer** `{{token}}`. Wrong fields for an endpoint return **400** `Field \"x\" is not allowed on this update endpoint.`",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Basic details",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "try {",
                      "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "  const t = j?.data?.auth_token;",
                      "  if (t) {",
